    "detailed_description": "<h1>Just Updated</h1><p><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480720/extras/c294467c29182bea9f34d3e5614ed32e.avif?t=1696000027\" /></span><br>-------------------------------------------------------------------------<br>Updated(September 30, 2023)<br>+ New stage. ( Difficulty : Nightmare )<br>+ Fix HitPoints.<br>+ Fix Code.<br>+ Uploading scores to the Steam leaderboard is now optional.<br>+ etc...<br>-------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>This game is a single player FPS where you have 10 minutes to fight zombies in different locations, test your zombie survival skills and compete for high scores.<br><strong>(This is a high difficulty game for the fiercest players who can easily complete the highest difficulty level of classic zombie games such as L4D2 and WWZ without difficulty.)</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480720/extras/49fd3819ed37866b6053e85a28c0cac2.avif?t=1696000027\" /></span><br><br>&quot;Prove your zombie survival skills&quot;<br><br>Do you have real zombie survival skills?<br><br>Are you burdening your friends with co-op play?<br>Aren't you spoiled by the movements of generous zombies?<br><br>Now it's time to test your zombie survival skills.<br>We have 12 deadly stages and a minimum of weapons.<br>The rules are very simple.<br>All you have to do is survive 10 minutes.<br><br>Only 10 minutes.<br><br><br>The enemy is fierce.<br>You are alone and there is no escape.<br>You must fight and survive.<br><br>I hope you survive...<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480720/extras/468a1ca6cdcb2aa7814c7002e7788a64.avif?t=1696000027\" /></span><br><br>/---Game overview---/<br><br>The goal of this game is to survive 10 minutes on a stage with monsters.<br>This game depends only on your abilities.<br><br>Gameplay is rated last.<br> -How many minutes did you survive?<br> -How difficult is the stage?<br> -What is your HP setting?<br> -How many kills?<br> etc...<br><br>Based on the evaluation, the zombie survival skill level and score ranking will be determined.<br><br>Game controls are simple and easy.<br>It's a casual FPS.<br>Game controls are easy, but each stage is very difficult.<br>There are 4 difficulty levels and 12 stages.<br>Even the easiest stages may be difficult to clear for those who are not good at action games and FPS.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480720/extras/7a98aeaf4cdb9eed8865863c523f41a5.avif?t=1696000027\" /></span><br><br>Nightmare difficulty is hopeless.<br><br>Even veterans who have completed the highest difficulty of classic zombie games will have a hard time.<br>You have no choice but to try if you are a &quot;professional zombie slayer&quot;.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2480720/extras/94f8a897637eebe71104583ec0e31192.avif?t=1696000027\" /></span><br><br>You can bet your HP to get higher kill points.<br><br>This is necessary to prove that you are the best zombie slayer in the world.<br><br>...I don't know if you'll survive.",
